with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span id="xdx_900_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20231218__20231218_z25xKBFVBHy5"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-12-18" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

